%% Figure 9 — Human-reviewed AI Advisory Processing
flowchart LR
  User([Authorized user]) --> Feature[Request Similar Bugs, Classification,\nHandoff Summary or Assignment Explanation]
  Feature --> Input[CAP builds bounded allowlisted input]
  Input --> Safety[Redact sensitive text\nand validate request limits]
  Safety --> Provider{Configured provider\navailable?}
  Provider -- Yes --> Route[Select feature-specific\nmodel alias and timeout]
  Route --> Call[Call bounded AI provider]
  Call --> Success{Valid grounded\nresponse?}
  Provider -- No --> Fallback[Use deterministic fallback]
  Success -- No --> Fallback
  Success -- Yes --> Advisory[Normalize advisory output]
  Fallback --> Advisory
  Advisory --> Audit[(Persist sanitized AI suggestion\nand operational metric)]
  Audit --> Review[Display advisory for human review]
  Review --> Decision{Accept, Reject\nor Ignore?}
  Decision --> ReviewState[(Record reviewer and\nreview state only)]
  ReviewState --> Mutation{Separate authorized\nbusiness action requested?}
  Mutation -- No --> NoMutation([Review recorded\nNo business mutation])
  Mutation -- Yes --> Revalidate[Re-read Bug and revalidate\nrole, state and current catalogs]
  Revalidate --> Apply{Action type}
  Apply -- Apply Classification --> Classification[(Update validated classification\nand append history)]
  Apply -- Confirm Duplicate --> Duplicate[(Create confirmed relationship\nwithout changing Bug status)]
  Classification --> BusinessResult([Return validated business result])
  Duplicate --> BusinessResult

  classDef action fill:#eef5ff,stroke:#2b88d9,color:#172b4d;
  classDef decision fill:#f2edff,stroke:#7f65c5,color:#172b4d;
  classDef storage fill:#ecf8f1,stroke:#398b63,color:#172b4d;
  class User,Feature,Input,Safety,Route,Call,Fallback,Advisory,Review,Revalidate,NoMutation,BusinessResult action;
  class Provider,Success,Decision,Mutation,Apply decision;
  class Audit,ReviewState,Classification,Duplicate storage;
